// Apple Developer team switch — the ONE file to edit once a paid Apple Developer Program membership exists
// (see .claude/notes/07-notifications.md and docs/push-setup.md). Included by Debug.xcconfig and Release.xcconfig;
// deliberately NOT by PersonalTeamDebug.xcconfig (.claude/notes/18-ios-personal-team-signing.md), which stays a
// free/personal-team build with no paid capability at all.
//
// After buying the Apple Developer Program: set your Team ID below and BANBE_PAID_ACCOUNT = YES
// (or run `node scripts/apple-team-setup.mjs`), then `xcodegen generate` in apps/ios.
//   - Debug then signs with BanbeAppPush.entitlements (aps-environment) and compiles the ENABLE_PUSH code
//     (permission prompt, token registration, push taps, app badge).
//   - Release always has push on; it only needs the Team ID.
// Leave it as it is (empty team, NO) for a free/personal Apple ID: Debug then omits aps-environment entirely,
// exactly as before.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
BANBE_PAID_ACCOUNT = NO
